e":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2308842274,"text":"オーイ——おまえが戴か？","nextNodeIds":[111200202]},{"nodeId":111200202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10377,"speakerName":"戴","textMapHash":1732579170,"text":"おう、俺に何か用か？","nextNodeIds":[111200203]},{"nodeId":111200203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10377,"speakerName":"戴","textMapHash":1297941162,"text":"ん？ひょっとして協会からきた冒険者か？","nextNodeIds":[111200204]},{"nodeId":111200204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1484997170,"text":"えっ、分かるのか！？","nextNodeIds":[111200205]},{"nodeId":111200205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10377,"speakerName":"戴","textMapHash":4001025818,"text":"その恰好と顔つきを見れば、相当なやり手だっていうのがすぐに分かるさ。","nextNodeIds":[111200206]},{"nodeId":111200206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":431584458,"text":"ふふん、なかなか見る目があるな！","nextNodeIds":[111200207]},{"nodeId":111200207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10377,"speakerName":"戴","textMapHash":2205906970,"text":"ハハハッ、この業界にいると、鑑定の仕事も多く任される。石も人間も、この戴にかかれば一目で見極められるってもんよ。","nextNodeIds":[111200208]},{"nodeId":111200208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10377,"speakerName":"戴","textMapHash":2728772994,"text":"二人とも少し待っててくれ、もう一人の助っ人がそろそろ来るはずなんだ。","nextNodeIds":[111200209]},{"nodeId":111200209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":303723274,"text":"ちょっと待てよ、仕事はオイラたちに頼むんだろ？他の助っ人と報酬を山分けするなんてことないよな？","nextNodeIds":[111200210]},{"nodeId":111200210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10377,"speakerName":"戴","textMapHash":131752890,"text":"はぁ、正直なところ、今回の一件はかなり厄介なんだ。冒険者だけじゃまだ心許なくてな、それで…","nextNodeIds":[111200211]},{"nodeId":111200211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3913203858,"text":"おいおい、他の人にも頼んだのかよ！","nextNodeIds":[111200212]},{"nodeId":111200212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1951154706,"text":"オジサン、オイラたちの腕を舐めてもらっちゃ困るぞ。","nextNodeIds":[111200213,111200214]},{"nodeId":111200213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1214890610,"text":"パイモン、そんなこと言わない…","nextNodeIds":[111200215]},{"nodeId":111200215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10377,"speakerName":"戴","textMapHash":381040250,"text":"お前たちはまだ詳しい事情を知らないだろう、今回の一件は鉱山で起きたことでな…しかも、ただ事じゃない。それに鉱山に事故は付き物だ。だから念のため、この業界の専門家にも依頼したんだ。","nextNodeIds":[111200216]},{"nodeId":111200216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10377,"speakerName":"戴","textMapHash":939053026,"text":"鉱石鑑定や地質分析とかは、冒険者には荷が重いだろ？専門家を連れていくのも、いざという時のためさ。","nextNodeIds":[111200217]},{"nodeId":111200217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10377,"speakerName":"戴","textMapHash":1996153106,"text":"それに、俺が見つけた人は玄人中の玄人。どんな石だろうと、その人なら一目見ただけでお見通しなんだ。","nextNodeIds":[111200218]},{"nodeId":111200218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10377,"speakerName":"戴","textMapHash":421427810,"text":"俺の見立てでは、あの人は世界で一番鉱石に詳しい！そんな専門家を知ってたら、依頼しない手はないだろ？","nextNodeIds":[111200219]},{"nodeId":111200219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":268075538,"text":"ちょっと待て。世界で一番鉱石に詳しい人は、その人じゃないと思うぞ？","nextNodeIds":[111200220]},{"nodeId":111200220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10377,"speakerName":"戴","textMapHash":191038874,"text":"どうしてだ？","nextNodeIds":[111200221]},{"nodeId":111200221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2555394850,"text":"だって、一番詳しい人はオイラたちの友達にいるからな！","nextNodeIds":[111200222]},{"nodeId":111200222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":835839594,"text":"それって、もしかして…","nextNodeIds":[111200223]},{"nodeId":111200223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2801029186,"text":"（ちょうど彼に聞きたいことがある。）","nextNodeIds":[111200224]},{"nodeId":111200224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3678425754,"text":"ふふん、上には上がいるってのを教えてやるぜ！ここで待